@bank all
// B3 (2026-10-26, Pillar 5 Step 5, S5-5; lead 40: no writer seat, the builder writes its own leftovers): M20 The sensor
// array (24x), the keys the code reads that SW3's m20.lines (claude/p5s5-words) doesn't have. Same style. {time}: 10:00.
// Keep these keys out of m20.lines (one home each).

// the job board's cards
== m20.card.cal
- Calibrate the sensor array
== m20.card.sweep
- A full sweep: the sensor array
// the dial's card title names it ({machine} in SW3's m20.cal.title)
== m20.array.name
- the sensor array
// the array's modules, read at the panel ("M1 green · M2 amber ...")
== m20.module.green
- green
== m20.module.amber
- amber
// said in person after the ask, the first time you're near the teacher (Mori, or Calder on Mori's days off)
== m20.ask.say
- You're the one Calder sent? {time}, the array room on Deck 2. Bring your eyes.
